          "Do not solve a first-day packets coverage gap with a shared login. Give each coordinator an individual account with only the permissions required for the written scope. Remove those permissions when the assignment changes or ends. The access record is part of the control, not an IT afterthought. At HR Coordinators, the first-day packets owner confirms the access change before the next cycle."
